---
// About Us Section
---

<section id="about" class="bg-white py-20 lg:py-24" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:about-sec">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:39jdro">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:39jdrp">
      <!-- Left Column: Story & Highlights -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-start" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:39jdrq">
        <span class="text-[12px] font-bold text-primary tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:mzecru">About Kippy Ellis Group</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-[30px] font-normal text-foreground leading-[1.2] mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:5p9d9y">
          Your Home, Our Priority Across West Michigan
        </h2>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-muted-foreground leading-[26px]" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:39jdrr">
          <p data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:jf35gu">
            At Five Star Real Estate, Kippy Ellis and the Kippy Ellis Group bring exceptional dedication, local expertise, and warm personal attention to every client. Serving Grand Rapids, Holland, the Lakeshore, and surrounding West Michigan communities, your real estate goals are always our top priority.
          </p>
          <p data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:jf35gt">
            Whether you are buying your first home, looking for a waterfront retreat on Lake Michigan, or selling your current property for maximum return, you will receive honest guidance, thorough market analysis, and constant communication every step of the way.
          </p>
          <p data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:jf35gs">
            Real estate decisions are some of the most significant life milestones you will make. With deep local roots and an unwavering commitment to your best interests, Kippy and our team make the process smooth, informed, and rewarding.
          </p>
          <p data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:jf35gr">
            From neighborhood-level market data to customized marketing plans and skilled negotiation, you get the full power of Five Star Real Estate's network and Kippy Ellis Group's client-first approach.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3 Highlight Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-border" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:39jdrs">
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border p-5 rounded-[8px] flex flex-col items-start gap-3" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4sz4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[6px] bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4sz3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-[16px] font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:kdoai7">Honest & Dedicated</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-surface border border-border p-5 rounded-[8px] flex flex-col items-start gap-3" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4sz2">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[6px] bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4sz1">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-[16px] font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:kdoahl">Local Market Expert</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-surface border border-border p-5 rounded-[8px] flex flex-col items-start gap-3" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4sz0">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[6px] bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4syz">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-[16px] font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:kdoahk">Client-First Focus</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Agent Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4syy">
        <div class="bg-[#EFF6F9] border border-[#DEEAEF] rounded-[12px] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center shadow-xs" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4syx">
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/5] max-w-[340px] overflow-hidden rounded-[8px] mb-6 shadow-xs" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4syw">
            <img
              src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ab210347/images/rs=w:600,cg:true-320.webp"
              alt="Kippy Ellis, Realtor"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
              loading="lazy" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:ra9g7" />
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="font-heading text-[24px] font-normal text-foreground mb-1" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:kdoahj">Kippy Ellis</h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] font-medium text-muted-foreground mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:jf35gq">Lead REALTOR® | Five Star Real Estate</p>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 w-full pt-4 border-t border-[#DEEAEF]/80" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4syv">
            <a href="tel:+16164370205" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-[14px] font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-primary no-underline transition-colors" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:cb58r4">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
              </svg>
              <span data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:mzecrv">(616) 437-0205</span>
            </a>
            
            <a href="mailto:kippy@fivestar.com" class="text-[14px] text-primary hover:text-primary-hover underline underline-offset-2 break-all no-underline transition-colors" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:cb58r3">
              kippy@fivestar.com
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
